tools": [{"name": "manage_pages", "allowed_actions": ["create_widget", "rename_page", "delete_page", "create_page", "list_pages"]}, {"name": "manage_graphics", "allowed_actions": ["create_text", "create_rect", "delete_widget", "create_circle", "create_line", "group_widgets"]}, {"name": "manage_scripts", "allowed_actions": ["create_script", "list_scripts", "delete_script", "disable_script"]}, {"name": "manage_schedules", "allowed_actions": ["create_schedule", "add_schedule_action"]}, {"name": "manage_trends", "allowed_actions": ["add_trend_pen", "create_trend_group"]}, {"name": "manage_points", "allowed_actions": ["create_point"]}], "visible_count": 6, "selected": "manage_graphics", "action": "create_text", "args": {"action": "create_text", "page_id": "main_page", "widget_id": "welcome_text", "position": [50, 50], "text": "欢迎", "font_size": 24, "style": {"color": "#333333", "fontWeight": "bold"}}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"widget_id": "welcome_text", "page_id": "main_page", "type": "text"}, "world_diff": {"added_or_modified": {"pages.main_page.widgets.welcome_text": {"id": "welcome_text", "page_id": "main_page", "type": "text", "position": [50, 50], "size": [32, 28], "bindings": {}, "expected_binding_types": {}, "style": {"color": "#333333", "fontWeight": "bold", "text": "欢迎", "font_size": 24}}}, "removed": []}, "latency_ms": 1.543800000945339, "intended_entities": ["pages.main_page.widgets.welcome_text"], "referenced_entities": ["pages.main_page"]}], "resource_reads": [], "world_snapshots": {"initial_hash": "sha256:ce96f177661087f9ab86d524efd537215f5b6cd00506ab99fc00db443f21ff72", "final_hash": "sha256:c1567ce65dd756aa5a0c3cc3f684f07261320d4e6a6cd6ffb1da2c991955def3", "final_state_match": null, "match_mode": null, "diff_against_expected": {}}, "llm_calls": [{"turn": 1, "model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "input_tokens": 4967, "output_tokens": 130, "latency_ms": 2276.067399998283, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "好的，我先查看一下当前已有的页面，看看是否有\"主页面\"。", "reasoning": "用户想在一个名为\"主页面\"的页面上添加一个文本组件，显示\"欢迎\"。但我需要先知道这个主页面是否已经存在。让我先列出所有页面，看看是否有\"主页面\"或类似的页面。\n\n当前阶段是 ANALYZE_INTENT，我需要先了解页面情况。让我先查询已有页面。"}, {"turn": 2, "model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "input_tokens": 5149, "output_tokens": 404, "latency_ms": 4009.5448000029137, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "已经有了一个名为\"主页面\"的页面（ID: `main_page`）。现在我在该页面上添加一个显示\"欢迎\"的文本组件。", "reasoning": "已经有一个名为\"主页面\"的页面，其ID是\"main_page\"。现在我需要在这个页面上创建一个文本组件，显示\"欢迎\"。\n\n对于创建文本组件，我应该使用 `manage_graphics` 工具中的 `create_text` 动作。\n\n参数需要：\n- page_id: \"main_page\"\n- widget_id: 需要一个唯一的ID，我可以设为 \"welcome_text\"\n- position: 需要指定位置，用户没给，我可以用一个合理的默认位置，比如 (100, 100)\n- text: \"欢迎\"\n- font_size: 可以默认14，也可以设大一点比如24\n- style: 可选\n\n用户没有指定位置和字体大小，但为了让\"欢迎\"在主页面上显示，我需要设置这些参数。我可以选择一个合理的默认值。或者我可以先问用户位置？但一般这种简单任务，给个居中或左上角位置就行。\n\n我设一个合理的位置吧，比如左上角 (50, 50)，字号大一点24号。"}, {"turn": 3, "model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "input_tokens": 5600, "output_tokens": 121, "latency_ms": 2104.882700001326, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "✅ **操作完成！** 已在 **主页面**（`main_page`）上成功添加一个文本组件，显示 **\"欢迎\"**。\n\n**配置详情：**\n- 文本内容：欢迎\n- 位置：`(50, 50)`\n- 字号：`24px`（加粗）\n- 颜色：深灰色（`#333333`）\n\n如果您需要调整文本的位置、大小或样式，请随时告诉我！\n\nnext_state: DONE", "reasoning": "文本组件已经成功创建。现在任务完成了，我应该通知用户并切换到 DONE 状态。"}], "rag": {"enabled": true, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 20, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": true, "selected_workflow": null}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 15716, "output_tokens": 655, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 8428.007599999546}, "judge": null}
