high_limit": 100, "priority": "high"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"alarm_id": "TI-201_HH"}, "world_diff": {"added_or_modified": {"alarms.TI-201_HH": {"id": "TI-201_HH", "tag": "TI-201", "type": "analog", "high_limit": 100.0, "low_limit": null, "deadband": 0.0, "priority": "high", "enabled": true}}, "removed": []}, "latency_ms": 1.4390000033017714, "intended_entities": ["alarms.TI-201_HH"], "referenced_entities": ["points.TI-201"]}, {"turn": 2, "state": "CONFIG_ALARM", "visible_tools": [{"name": "manage_alarms", "allowed_actions": ["create_digital_alarm", "create_analog_alarm", "set_threshold", "delete_alarm", "disable_alarm", "enable_alarm"]}, {"name": "manage_points", "allowed_actions": ["list_points"]}], "visible_count": 2, "selected": "manage_alarms", "action": "create_analog_alarm", "args": {"action": "create_analog_alarm", "id": "TI-201_LL", "tag": "TI-201", "low_limit": 10, "priority": "high"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"alarm_id": "TI-201_LL"}, "world_diff": {"added_or_modified": {"alarms.TI-201_LL": {"id": "TI-201_LL", "tag": "TI-201", "type": "analog", "high_limit": null, "low_limit": 10.0, "deadband": 0.0, "priority": "high", "enabled": true}}, "removed": []}, "latency_ms": 1.079800000297837, "intended_entities": ["alarms.TI-201_LL"], "referenced_entities": ["points.TI-201"]}], "resource_reads": [], "world_snapshots": {"initial_hash": "sha256:5c36a73b4c1d2de1572720df5fcdfadf57212e64b3121822dbe294c91f962227", "final_hash": "sha256:05c6700f988adc139d71feadae75a478d9bf1bae1cafb24aa10c723956d1196d", "final_state_match": null, "match_mode": null, "diff_against_expected": {}}, "llm_calls": [{"turn": 1, "model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "input_tokens": 982, "output_tokens": 202, "latency_ms": 2304.894399996556, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "好的！我先查一下系统中现有的点位，看看 TI-201 是否存在。", "reasoning": "用户想要为某个点位配置报警。当前阶段是 ANALYZE_INTENT，但工作流上下文显示是 AlarmConfig 的 discover_points 步骤。\n\n让我先看看当前有哪些点位。我需要先查询现有点位信息。\n\n等等，当前阶段是 ANALYZE_INTENT，可用工具包括 manage_pages 的 list_pages 和 manage_points 的 list_points。不过工作流上下文显示当前 workflow=AlarmConfig, step=discover_points。\n\n用户的需求是为 TI-201 设置 HH 报警（100）和 LL 报警（10），优先级为 high。\n\n但是我需要先确认系统中是否存在 TI-201 这个点位。让我先查询一下现有的点位列表。"}, {"turn": 2, "model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "input_tokens": 2127, "output_tokens": 546, "latency_ms": 4518.204699998023, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "TI-201 是一个模拟量点位，可以配置模拟量报警。我现在为您创建 HH 报警（上限 100）和 LL 报警（下限 10），均为高优先级。", "reasoning": "好的，TI-201 是一个模拟量点位（analog），可以配置模拟量报警。\n\n用户想要：\n1. 为 TI-201 设置 HH alarm，阈值在 100，优先级 high\n2. 为 TI-201 设置 LL alarm，阈值在 10，优先级 high\n\n这两个可以分别创建为模拟量报警。我需要创建两个独立的 alarm：\n\n1. 一个 HH 报警：high_limit=100，priority=high\n2. 一个 LL 报警：low_limit=10，priority=high\n\n或者，也可以在一个报警中同时设置 high_limit 和 low_limit。但通常 HH 和 LL 是分开的报警，不过 create_analog_alarm 允许同时设置 high_limit 和 low_limit。\n\n考虑到 HH 和 LL 可能是不同的报警实体（alarm id 不同），我应该创建两个独立的 alarm。\n\n但也可以创建一个同时包含 high_limit=100 和 low_limit=10 的报警，但用户说的是 \"HH alarm 和 LL alarm\"，看起来是独立的两个报警。\n\n让我创建两个独立的报警：\n1. id: \"TI-201_HH\", tag: \"TI-201\", high_limit: 100, priority: \"high\"\n2. id: \"TI-201_LL\", tag: \"TI-201\", low_limit: 10, priority: \"high\""}, {"turn": 3, "model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "input_tokens": 5526, "output_tokens": 199, "latency_ms": 2522.324999998091, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "✅ **报警配置完成！** 已成功为 **TI-201** 创建了两个高优先级模拟量报警：\n\n| 报警 ID | 类型 | 阈值 | 优先级 |\n|---------|------|------|--------|\n| **TI-201_HH** | 高高报警 (High-High) | 上限 **100** | 🔴 high |\n| **TI-201_LL** | 低低报警 (Low-Low) | 下限 **10** | 🔴 high |\n\n接下来您还想做什么？例如：\n- 继续配置其他报警\n- 切换到 **BIND_POINTS** 阶段绑定点位到 HMI 页面\n- 切换到 **CONFIG_HISTORY** 配置历史记录\n- 或直接结束任务", "reasoning": "两个报警都创建成功了。现在用户是否还有其他报警配置需求？如果没有，可以询问用户是否需要切换到下一阶段或者完成。\n\n让我总结一下已完成的操作，然后询问用户下一步。"}], "rag": {"enabled": true, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 20, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": true, "selected_workflow": "AlarmConfig"}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 8635, "output_tokens": 947, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 9369.605399999273}, "judge": null}
