tag": "LEVEL_101", "type": "analog", "unit": "m", "min": 0, "max": 10, "description": "1号储罐液位传感器"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"tag": "LEVEL_101"}, "world_diff": {"added_or_modified": {"points.LEVEL_101": {"tag": "LEVEL_101", "type": "analog", "unit": "m", "min": 0.0, "max": 10.0, "description": "1号储罐液位传感器"}}, "removed": []}, "latency_ms": 1.0058000007120427, "intended_entities": ["points.LEVEL_101"], "referenced_entities": []}], "resource_reads": [], "world_snapshots": {"initial_hash": "sha256:43d4f3e3424d08e6d0df74e774e92c960d43209e2c18f450ef8c3b2b7ba60734", "final_hash": "sha256:fdc62f56b453a40f4c3f3f27919cbc1d436f5fc5ba6419ce9523ba0729890aa1", "final_state_match": null, "match_mode": null, "diff_against_expected": {}}, "llm_calls": [{"turn": 1, "model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "input_tokens": 5092, "output_tokens": 1056, "latency_ms": 8243.567700003041, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "好的！既然您让我做主，那我就为您添加几个工业场景中最常用的传感器点位。我决定添加以下 **4个模拟量传感器**：\n\n1. **TEMP_101** - 温度传感器 (°C)\n2. **PRESS_101** - 压力传感器 (bar)  \n3. **FLOW_101** - 流量传感器 (m³/h)\n4. **LEVEL_101** - 液位传感器 (m)\n\n这几个涵盖了温度、压力、流量、液位四大基础工艺参数，非常通用。我现在就来创建它们！", "reasoning": "用户想要我添加一些传感器点位，但没有指定具体的信息，比如点的名称、类型等。我需要根据常见的SCADA场景来决定。\n\n让我先想一想，用户说\"给我加几个传感器点\"，没有指定具体的数量、名称和类型。\n\n我需要先向用户确认一些信息，比如：\n1. 需要多少个传感器点？\n2. 是什么类型的传感器？（温度、压力、流量等）\n3. 模拟量还是数字量？\n4. 有没有具体的名字？\n\n由于信息不足，我应该先询问用户具体需求，不能擅自做决定。\n\n不过，让我再想想 - 用户说\"名字类型你决定\"，说明用户授权我来自行决定。这种情况下我可以做主。\n\n常见的传感器类型包括：\n- 温度传感器 (TEMP_101, TEMP_102, TEMP_103) - analog\n- 压力传感器 (PRESS_101, PRESS_102) - analog\n- 流量传感器 (FLOW_101, FLOW_102) - analog\n- 液位传感器 (LEVEL_101) - analog\n- 还有一些数字传感器如状态开关等\n\n用户说\"几个\"，通常3-5个比较合理。我决定添加几个常用的传感器点。\n\n让我创建几个典型的模拟量传感器点。\n\n我会这样决定：\n1. TEMP_101 - 温度传感器，模拟量，单位°C\n2. PRESS_101 - 压力传感器，模拟量，单位bar\n3. FLOW_101 - 流量传感器，模拟量，单位m³/h\n4. LEVEL_101 - 液位传感器，模拟量，单位m\n\n这样4个点，覆盖常见的传感器类型。\n\n不过，我还是先向用户确认一下数量比较好吧。但用户说\"名字类型你决定\"，就是让我全权决定。\n\n好吧，我就做主了，加4个常见的传感器点。"}, {"turn": 2, "model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "input_tokens": 6278, "output_tokens": 227, "latency_ms": 2278.145100000984, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "✅ **4个传感器点位已全部创建成功！** 以下是点位清单：\n\n| 点位名称 | 中文含义 | 类型 | 单位 | 量程 |\n|---------|---------|------|------|------|\n| **TEMP_101** | 1号反应器温度传感器 | analog | °C | -50 ~ 200 |\n| **PRESS_101** | 1号反应器压力传感器 | analog | bar | 0 ~ 100 |\n| **FLOW_101** | 进料管道流量传感器 | analog | m³/h | 0 ~ 500 |\n| **LEVEL_101** | 1号储罐液位传感器 | analog | m | 0 ~ 10 |\n\n如果您接下来需要：\n- 为这些点创建 **报警**（如温度超限报警）\n- 配置 **历史记录**（数据存入数据库）\n- 生成 **HMI页面**（绑定到仪表/趋势图等可视化控件）\n- 或者调整点位参数\n\n随时告诉我！", "reasoning": "所有点都已成功创建。让我总结一下给用户的回复。"}], "rag": {"enabled": true, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 20, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": true, "selected_workflow": null}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 11370, "output_tokens": 1283, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 10549.717300000339}, "judge": null}
{"trace_id": "7be4610c-c291-4d58-819d-65e9fb7f725c", "experiment": {"config_name": "D_hier_rag_workflow", "config_hash": "sha256:3f2603eb3c7045162e847c885ac9d1ab79e266cfd3af163ec43b1e5bcbbe2769", "code_commit": "6c299a18e517871b834f2a6226522e7c6e6c6e40", "model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "dataset_version": "dev", "rep_index": 0, "seed": 42}, "query": {"golden_id": "golden-041", "text": "给PT_COMP_01配置H和HH报警，H=2.8 medium，HH=3.2 high", "complexity": "complex", "domain": "alarm"}, "execution": {"started_at": "2026-06-16T10:36:58.889Z", "completed_at": "2026-06-16T10:37:08.765Z", "total_turns": 3, "terminal_state": "CONFIG_ALARM", "early_terminated": false, "termination_reason": null}, "states": [{"name": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "entered_at": "2026-06-16T10:36:58.889Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-16T10:37:00.657Z"}, {"name": "CONFIG_ALARM", "entered_at": "2026-06-16T10:37:00.657Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-16T10:37:08.765Z"}], "tool_calls": [{"turn": 1, "state": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "visible_tools": [{"name": "manage_pages", "allowed_actions": ["list_pages"]}, {"name": "manage_points", "allowed_actions": ["list_points"]}], "visible_count": 2, "selected": "manage_points", "action": "list_points", "args": {"action": "list_points"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"count": 1, "points": [{"tag": "PT_COMP_01", "type": "analog", "unit": "MPa", "min": null, "max": null, "description": null}]}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 1.3347000021894928, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": []}, {"turn": 2, "state": "CONFIG_ALARM", "visible_tools": [{"name": "manage_alarms", "allowed_actions": ["create_analog_alarm", "create_digital_alarm", "set_threshold", "disable_alarm", "enable_alarm", "delete_alarm"]}, {"name": "manage_points", "allowed_actions": ["list_points"]}], "visible_count": 2, "selected": "manage_alarms", "action": "create_analog_alarm", "args": {"action": "create_analog_alarm", "id": "alarm_PT_COMP_01_H", "tag": "PT_COMP_01", "high_limit": 2.8, "priority": "medium"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"alarm_id": "alarm_PT_COMP_01_H"}, "world_diff": {"added_or_modified": {"alarms.alarm_PT_COMP_01_H": {"id": "alarm_PT_COMP_01_H", "tag": "PT_COMP_01", "type": "analog", "high_limit": 2.8, "low_limit": null, "deadband": 0.0, "priority": "medium", "enabled": true}}, "removed": []}, "latency_ms": 1.4418999999179505, "intended_entities": ["alarms.alarm_PT_COMP_01_H"], "referenced_entities": ["points.PT_COMP_01"]}, {"turn": 2, "state": "CONFIG_ALARM", "visible_tools": [{"name": "manage_alarms", "allowed_actions": ["create_analog_alarm", "create_digital_alarm", "set_threshold", "disable_alarm", "enable_alarm", "delete_alarm"]}, {"name": "manage_points", "allowed_actions": ["list_points"]}], "visible_count": 2, "selected": "manage_alarms", "action": "create_analog_alarm", "args": {"action": "create_analog_alarm", "id": "alarm_PT_COMP_01_HH", "tag": "PT_COMP_01", "high_limit": 3.2, "priority": "high"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"alarm_id": "alarm_PT_COMP_01_HH"}, "world_diff": {"added_or_modified": {"alarms.alarm_PT_COMP_01_HH": {"id": "alarm_PT_COMP_01_HH", "tag": "PT_COMP_01", "type": "analog", "high_limit": 3.2, "low_limit": null, "deadband": 0.0, "priority": "high", "enabled": true}}, "removed": []}, "latency_ms": 1.0632000012265053, "intended_entities": ["alarms.alarm_PT_COMP_01_HH"], "referenced_entities": ["points.PT_COMP_01"]}], "resource_reads": [], "world_snapshots": {"initial_hash": "sha256:576dd46c892d0c478ef4b7488319f2e1c34a7300eb6d42b30de204ee1da452a3", "final_hash": "sha256:dafd917d1b1d6f1d93dcd88a6e239e2b7cc3b9fe6307cc0986c63c57648c907c", "final_state_match": null, "match_mode": null, "diff_against_expected": {}}, "llm_calls": [{"turn": 1, "model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "input_tokens": 986, "output_tokens": 123, "latency_ms": 1763.7123999993491, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "好的，我来先查询一下系统中现有的点，看看 **PT_COMP_01** 是否存在。", "reasoning": "用户想要给 PT_COMP_01 这个点配置报警。目前处于 ANALYZE_INTENT 阶段，当前 workflow=AlarmConfig, step=discover_points。\n\n首先，我需要看看当前有哪些点可以操作。先列出已有的点，看看 PT_COMP_01 是否存在。"}, {"turn": 2, "model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "input_tokens": 2054, "output_tokens": 554, "latency_ms": 4816.662799999904, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "**PT_COMP_01** 存在，是 **analog（模拟量）** 类型，单位 **MPa**。\n\n对于 H 和 HH 两级高报警，我需要创建两条独立的模拟量报警记录，分别对应不同的阈值和优先级。开始配置：", "reasoning": "PT_COMP_01 存在，是 analog（模拟量）类型。用户想要配置两个报警：\n\n1. H（高报）: 阈值 2.8，优先级 medium\n2. HH（高高报）: 阈值 3.2，优先级 high\n\n在SCADA中，通常用 create_analog_alarm 来创建模拟量报警。但是一个analog alarm通常只能有一个high_limit和一个low_limit。用户想要两个不同的高报警级别（H和HH）。\n\n通常的做法有两种：\n1. 创建两个独立的模拟量报警，一个对应H（high_limit=2.8），一个对应HH（high_limit=3.2）\n2. 或者用一个报警设置两个阈值\n\n不过看工具的定义，create_analog_alarm 的参数中只有一个 high_limit 和 low_limit。所以需要创建两个报警：\n\n- 报警1：id 比如 \"alarm_PT_COMP_01_H\"，tag=\"PT_COMP_01\"，high_limit=2.8，priority=\"medium\"\n- 报警2：id 比如 \"alarm_PT_COMP_01_HH\"，tag=\"PT_COMP_01\"，high_limit=3.2，priority=\"high\"\n\n这样两个报警可以独立配置不同的优先级。"}, {"turn": 3, "model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "input_tokens": 6111, "output_tokens": 244, "latency_ms": 3270.648199999414, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "✅ **两个报警已成功配置！** 以下是配置汇总：\n\n| 报警 | ID | 点位 | 阈值 (MPa) | 优先级 |\n|------|-----|------|-----------|--------|\n| **H（高报）** | `alarm_PT_COMP_01_H` | PT_COMP_01 | **2.8** | **medium** |\n| **HH（高高报）** | `alarm_PT_COMP_01_HH` | PT_COMP_01 | **3.2** | **high** |\n\n当 PT_COMP_01 的值超过 **2.8 MPa** 时将触发 **H报警（中等优先级）**，超过 **3.2 MPa** 时将触发 **HH报警（高优先级）**。\n\n请问还需要继续配置其他内容吗？比如：\n- 为这些报警添加**通知规则**（发短信/邮件等）\n- 创建**HMI页面绑定**（在画面上显示报警）\n- 或者结束当前任务\n\n如果没有其他需求，可以告知我结束任务。", "reasoning": "两个报警都已成功创建。现在我来总结一下，并询问用户是否还需要其他操作，或者可以结束任务。"}], "rag": {"enabled": true, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 20, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": true, "selected_workflow": "AlarmConfig"}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 9151, "output_tokens": 921, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 9876.176599998871}, "judge": null}
