g_alarm", "args": {"action": "create_analog_alarm", "id": "alarm_pt_comp_01_H", "tag": "PT_COMP_01", "high_limit": 2.8, "priority": "medium"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"alarm_id": "alarm_pt_comp_01_H"}, "world_diff": {"added_or_modified": {"alarms.alarm_pt_comp_01_H": {"id": "alarm_pt_comp_01_H", "tag": "PT_COMP_01", "type": "analog", "high_limit": 2.8, "low_limit": null, "deadband": 0.0, "priority": "medium", "enabled": true}}, "removed": []}, "latency_ms": 1.3158999972802121, "intended_entities": ["alarms.alarm_pt_comp_01_H"], "referenced_entities": ["points.PT_COMP_01"]}, {"turn": 2, "state": "CONFIG_ALARM", "visible_tools": [{"name": "manage_alarms", "allowed_actions": ["create_analog_alarm", "create_digital_alarm", "set_threshold", "disable_alarm", "enable_alarm", "delete_alarm"]}, {"name": "manage_points", "allowed_actions": ["list_points"]}], "visible_count": 2, "selected": "manage_alarms", "action": "create_analog_alarm", "args": {"action": "create_analog_alarm", "id": "alarm_pt_comp_01_HH", "tag": "PT_COMP_01", "high_limit": 3.2, "priority": "high"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"alarm_id": "alarm_pt_comp_01_HH"}, "world_diff": {"added_or_modified": {"alarms.alarm_pt_comp_01_HH": {"id": "alarm_pt_comp_01_HH", "tag": "PT_COMP_01", "type": "analog", "high_limit": 3.2, "low_limit": null, "deadband": 0.0, "priority": "high", "enabled": true}}, "removed": []}, "latency_ms": 1.0629999997036066, "intended_entities": ["alarms.alarm_pt_comp_01_HH"], "referenced_entities": ["points.PT_COMP_01"]}], "resource_reads": [], "world_snapshots": {"initial_hash": "sha256:576dd46c892d0c478ef4b7488319f2e1c34a7300eb6d42b30de204ee1da452a3", "final_hash": "sha256:6602b0b80c678f79e579e85b9e5c8b8db9d9d7f8eb2b8fe58e7a560af8c69d98", "final_state_match": null, "match_mode": null, "diff_against_expected": {}}, "llm_calls": [{"turn": 1, "model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "input_tokens": 986, "output_tokens": 253, "latency_ms": 2588.115199996537, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "好的！我先查询一下系统中现有的点位信息，确认一下 `PT_COMP_01` 是否已存在。", "reasoning": "用户想要给点位 PT_COMP_01 配置报警，具体是 H（高限）报警和 HH（高高限）报警。\n\n根据当前 workflow=AlarmConfig, step=discover_points，我需要先了解当前已有点位的情况。\n\n目前可用的工具有：\n1. manage_pages - 只能 list_pages\n2. manage_points - 只能 list_points\n\n当前阶段是 ANALYZE_INTENT，可切换的阶段包括：ASK_USER, BIND_POINTS, CONFIG_ALARM, CONFIG_HISTORY, CONFIG_POINT, CONFIG_SCRIPT, DEPLOY, DONE, GENERATE_LAYOUT, MANAGE_PAGES, VALIDATE\n\n对于报警配置，显然需要进入 CONFIG_ALARM 阶段。但在此之前，我需要先看看当前有哪些点位，确认 PT_COMP_01 是否存在。\n\n让我先列出所有点位看看。"}, {"turn": 2, "model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "input_tokens": 2184, "output_tokens": 573, "latency_ms": 4954.1567999986, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "好的！系统中已存在模拟量点 `PT_COMP_01`（单位：MPa），现在我来为您创建两个独立的报警：\n\n1. **H 报警**：高限 2.8，优先级 medium  \n2. **HH 报警**：高高限 3.2，优先级 high\n\n这两个报警没有依赖关系，可以同时创建：", "reasoning": "好的，`PT_COMP_01` 是一个模拟量点（analog），单位是 MPa。现在我在 CONFIG_ALARM 阶段，可用工具是 manage_alarms。\n\n用户想要配置 H 和 HH 报警：\n1. H (高限报警) - 阈值 2.8, 优先级 medium\n2. HH (高高限报警) - 阈值 3.2, 优先级 high\n\n对于模拟量报警，我可以用 create_analog_alarm。\n\n但问题是，一个报警 ID 只能设置 high_limit 和 low_limit。用户想要两个独立的报警：H 和 HH，它们是不同的报警条件。\n\n所以需要创建两个报警：\n1. alarm_pt_comp_01_H - high_limit=2.8, priority=medium\n2. alarm_pt_comp_01_HH - high_limit=3.2, priority=high\n\n不过，思考一下 - 在工业 SCADA 中，通常 H 和 HH 是两个独立的报警，分别触发。让我创建两个报警。\n\n我先创建 H 报警（high=2.8, priority=medium）和 HH 报警（high=3.2, priority=high）。\n\n两个报警之间没有依赖关系，可以同时创建。"}, {"turn": 3, "model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "input_tokens": 6262, "output_tokens": 255, "latency_ms": 2743.873999999778, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "✅ **配置成功！** 已为 `PT_COMP_01` 创建了两个模拟量报警：\n\n| 报警ID | 类型 | 高限 | 优先级 | 状态 |\n|--------|------|------|--------|------|\n| `alarm_pt_comp_01_H` | H（高限） | **2.8 MPa** | **medium** | ✅ 已创建 |\n| `alarm_pt_comp_01_HH` | HH（高高限） | **3.2 MPa** | **high** | ✅ 已创建 |\n\n当 `PT_COMP_01` 的值超过 2.8 MPa 时，H 报警会触发（medium 优先级）；超过 3.2 MPa 时，HH 报警会触发（high 优先级）。如有其他需求，欢迎继续提出！\n\nnext_state: DONE", "reasoning": "两个报警都创建成功了。用户的需求已经完成，我应该告知用户结果并结束任务。\n\n不过让我看看用户是否还有其他需求。用户说\"给PT_COMP_01配置H和HH报警，H=2.8 medium，HH=3.2 high\"，已经全部完成了。\n\n现在可以结束任务，输出 \"next_state: DONE\"。"}], "rag": {"enabled": true, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 20, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": true, "selected_workflow": "AlarmConfig"}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 9432, "output_tokens": 1081, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 10310.375600001862}, "judge": null}
